# reading_translation = He who could recount from far back the origin of men spoke, and said that the Almighty made the earth, the shining plain, as water surrounds it, and, victorious, set the sun and moon as lights for earth-dwellers, and adorned the regions of the earth with branches and leaves; he also created life for each of the races of those that move about alive.
