# reading_translation = Nor could any man, whether friend or foe, dissuade you two from that perilous undertaking, when you two rowed on the sea; there you two covered the sea-current with your arms, measured the sea-ways, moved your hands quickly, glided over the ocean; the sea surged with waves, with winter's billows.
