# text = Hwæpere hē his folme forlēt tō līfwrape lāst weardian, earm ond eaxle; nō þǣr ǣnige swā þēah fēasceaft guma frōfre gebohte; nō þȳ leng leofað lāðgetēona synnum geswenced, ac hyne sār hafað in nīdgripe nearwe befongen, balwon bendum; ðǣr ābīdan sceal maga māne fāh miclan dōmes, hū him scīr Metod scrīfan wille.'
