# reading_translation = However, he let his hand remain behind as a life-pledge, arm and shoulder; yet no wretched man thereby obtained any comfort; no longer does the hostile assailant live, harassed by sins, but pain has tightly clutched him in a dire grip, in deadly bonds; there the man guilty of wickedness must await the great judgement, how the glorious God will decree for him.'
# literal_translation = However he his hand let go as life-pledge track to guard, arm and shoulder; not there any however wretched man comfort obtained; not by that longer lives hostile assailant with sins harassed, but him pain has in dire grip tightly clutched, in deadly bonds; there await shall man of wickedness guilty of great judgement, how for him glorious God decree will.'
