# reading_translation = Hengest still remained with Finn through the slaughter-stained winter, all without blame; he remembered his homeland, though he could drive the ring-prowed ship on the sea—the water surged with storm, struggled against the wind, winter locked the waves in icy bonds, until another year came into the courts—as even now it does, for those who always observe the seasons, gloriously bright weather.
# literal_translation = Hengest then still the slaughter-stained winter remained with Finn all without blame; homeland remembered, though he could on sea drive the ring-prowed ship—the water surged with storm, strove against the wind, winter locked the waves in icy bond, until other came year into courts—as now still does, those who always the seasons observe, gloriously bright weather.
