# text = Ic mīnne can glædne Hrōþulf, þæt hē þā geogoðe wile ārum healdan, gyf þū ǣr þonne hē, wine Scildinga, worold oflǣtest; wēne ic þæt hē mid gōde gyldan wille uncran eaferan, gif hē þæt eal gemon, hwæt wit tō willan ond tō worðmyndum umborwesendum ǣr ārna gefremedon.'
# ref = 1180-1187
# source_version = perseus-ang1
# base_analysis = Giuseppe Brunetti
