# reading_translation = I know my gracious Hrothulf, that he will treat the young men with kindness, if you, friend of the Scyldings, leave the world before him; I expect that he will repay our sons with good, if he remembers all that we two, while he was a child, formerly did for his benefit, for his pleasure and for his honour.'
