# reading_translation = One of them was, as far as they could most certainly determine, the likeness of a woman; the other, wretchedly shaped in a man's form, trod paths of exile, except that he was greater than any other man; in days of old the earth-dwellers called him Grendel; they do not know a father, whether any mysterious spirit had ever been begotten for him.
# literal_translation = Of-them one was, as they most-certainly ascertain could, of-a-woman likeness; other wretchedly-shaped in man's forms exile-paths trod, except that he was greater than any man other; that-one in days-of-yore Grendel called earth-dwellers; not they father know, whether to-him any was before begotten of-mysterious spirits.
