# reading_translation = He, the warrior of the Scyldings, fierce and deadly grim, seized the linked hilt, drew the ring-marked blade, despairing of life, and struck angrily, so that it grasped hard against her neck and broke the bone-rings; the sword passed entirely through the doomed body; she fell on the floor; the sword was bloody; the man rejoiced in the work.
# literal_translation = He grasped then the linked hilt, warrior of the Scyldings, fierce and deadly grim, the ring-marked (sword) drew, of life despairing, angrily struck, so that her against neck hard grasped, bone-rings broke; sword entirely passed-through the doomed body; she on floor fell, sword was bloody, man in the work rejoiced.
