# reading_translation = At times he lets a man's mind, the thought of a famous race, wander in delight; he gives him joy of the earth in his native land to hold, a stronghold of men; he makes the portions of the world so subject to him, a wide kingdom, that he himself in his folly cannot conceive its end.
