# reading_translation = Now the glory of your strength lasts but a while; soon afterward it will be that sickness or blade deprives you of strength, or the grip of fire, or the surge of flood, or the attack of a sword, or the flight of a spear, or terrible old age; or the brightness of your eyes grows weak and grows dim; presently it will be that death, lord of retainers, overcomes you.
