# sent_id = beowulf.00438
# text = Hwæt, mē þæs on ēþle edwenden cwōm, gyrn æfter gomene, seoþðan Grendel wearð, ealdgewinna, ingenga mīn; ic þǣre sōcne singāles wæg mōdceare micle, þæs sig Metode þanc, ēcean Dryhtne, þæs ðe ic on aldre gebād, þæt ic on þone hafelan heorodrēorigne ofer eald gewin ēagum starige!
# ref = 1774-1781
