# base_analysis = Giuseppe Brunetti
# dependency_model = deepseek-chat
# reading_translation = Listen, for that a reversal came to me in my native land, grief after gladness, after Grendel, the ancient adversary, became my invader; I continually bore great anxiety of mind for that persecution, thanks be to God, the eternal Lord, because I lived to experience in life that I may gaze with my eyes upon that sword-gory head after the ancient struggle!
