# reading_translation = The Geat was exceedingly eager for rest; the brave shield-warrior desired to rest. Immediately the chamberlain guided him, weary from his journey and come from afar, forth; he, out of courtesy, attended to all the retainer's needs, such as the sea-warriors had to have during that day.
