# sent_id = beowulf.00457
# text = Wēn ic talige, gif þæt gegangeð, þæt ðe gār nymeð, hild heorugrimme Hrēþles eaferan, ādl oþðe īren ealdor ðīnne, folces hyrde, ond þū þīn feorh hafast, þæt þe Sǣ-Gēatas sēlran næbben tō gecēosenne cyning ǣnigne, hordweard hæleþa, gyf þū healdan wylt māga rīce.
