# reading_translation = I consider it likely that, if it comes to pass that the spear takes you, fierce war takes Hrethel's son, or sickness or iron takes your lord, guardian of the people, and you still have your life, then the Sea-Geats will have no better king to choose, guardian of treasure of men, if you wish to hold the kingdom of your kinsmen.
