# reading_translation = There inside went some one of men, he who, near to the heathen hoard, grasped with his hand a broad, treasure-decorated cup; nor did he afterwards conceal it, though the thief, by his cunning, deceived him sleeping. The people, the noble troop of men, discovered that he was enraged.
# literal_translation = There inside went a certain one of men, he who, nigh to the heathen hoard, took with hand a broad, treasure-adorned cup; nor he that afterwards concealed, though him sleeping deceived was by thief's craft; that the people found out, noble troop of men, that he enraged was.
