# reading_translation = For him that became an end; there he received a mortal wound instead of hospitality, from the strokes of a sword, the son of Hygelac; and afterwards the son of Ongentheow departed to seek his home, after Heardred lay dead. He let Beowulf hold the princely seat, rule the Geats; that was a good king.
