# reading_translation = I was seven years old when the lord of treasures, the gracious friend of peoples, took me from my father; King Hrethel kept and held me, gave me treasure and banquet, remembered kinship; I was not in any way more hateful to him in life, a warrior in strongholds, than any one of his sons, Herebeald and Hæthcyn or my Hygelac.
# literal_translation = I was seven-winters, when me the lord of treasures, lord-friend of peoples, from my father received; kept me and had Hrethel king, gave me treasure and banquet, kinship remembered; not-was I to him in life more-hated in-anything, warrior in strongholds, than his of-sons any, Herebeald and Hæthcyn or Hygelac mine.
