# reading_translation = Then he advanced through the deadly reek, bore the war-helmet to the lord as support, and spoke a few words: 'Dear Beowulf, perform everything well, as you long ago said in your youth, that you would not let glory decline while you lived; now, brave in deeds, resolute prince, you must defend your life with all your strength; I will support you.'
