# text = Ic him līfwraðe lȳtle meahte ætgifan æt gūðe, ond ongan swā þēah ofer mīn gemet mǣges helpan; symle wæs þȳ sǣmra, þonne ic sweorde drep ferhðgenīðlan, fȳr unswīðor wēoll of gewitte.
