# literal_translation = Departed himself then the good one with his kinsmen, old much-saddened stronghold to seek, warrior Ongentheow higher up turned; had Hygelac's valour heard, proud one's strength in battle; resistance not trusted, that he seamen could withstand, sea-warriors hoard defend against, son and wife; retreated then thence old behind earth-wall.
